OL,3,AInside the room: What it was like to be
OL,4,Awith Blackpink's Lisa as race scandal
OL,5,Aerupted
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe clips, which emerged last year,
OL,8,Fshowed the band covering US rap songs
OL,9,Fduring rehearsals. Explicit language,
OL,10,Fincluding the n-word, was left
OL,11,Funcensored.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
