OL,3,AScreams, haunting scenes and deadly
OL,4,Ahide-and-seek, as Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,Aheats up
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,8,Fdetails from the fourth episode of The
OL,9,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,11,FBeing a Traitor must be a right
OL,12,Fnightmare.
OL,14,FWhile other people are out enjoying
OL,15,Ftheir lives, they have to kill it,
OL,16,Fnight after night. Even on the weekend,
OL,17,Fthere is no rest for the wicked.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
